The zuarrow package bundles the Apache Arrow nanoarrow C library and the
flatcc runtime it ships with. zuarrow is distributed under the MIT license.
nanoarrow and flatcc are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
except three flatcc portable headers under the MIT license and one under a
three-clause BSD license. The licences apply to their respective files; the
package as a whole is not MIT-licensed. inst/COPYRIGHTS lists each file and
its notice.


