in LICENSE.


nanoarrow and flatcc
====================

Bundled in src/vendor/nanoarrow/. Apache License, Version 2.0; the full text
is src/vendor/nanoarrow/LICENSE.txt and upstream's NOTICE is
src/vendor/nanoarrow/NOTICE.txt.
